# Copy to .env.local. Not a secret: NEXT_PUBLIC_* values are inlined into the
# bundle at build time. The CoinGecko key lives in the API proxy
# (apps/proxy/.dev.vars), never here.
#
# Where the API proxy runs. Leave empty for local development: the app uses
# `pnpm proxy` on this machine (http://localhost:8787).
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=
